---
import { getCollection } from "astro:content";
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import type { Language } from "../../config/site";

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return ["zh", "en"].map((lang) => ({ params: { lang }, props: { lang } }));
}

const { lang } = Astro.props as { lang: Language };
const isZh = lang === "zh";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const lessons = await getCollection("courses", ({ data }) => data.lang === "zh");
const counts = {
  history: lessons.filter(({ data }) => data.track === "history").length,
  economy: lessons.filter(({ data }) => data.track === "economy").length,
  math: lessons.filter(({ data }) => data.track === "math").length,
};
const total = counts.history + counts.economy + counts.math;
const tracks = [
  {
    id: "history",
    label: isZh ? "文明与历史" : "Civilization & history",
    title: isZh ? "从文明的源头，理解人类如何走到今天" : "Trace civilization from its origins to understand how humanity arrived here",
    description: isZh ? "从两河流域、埃及到爱琴海与荷马史诗，把环境、技术、经济、结构和艺术放进同一条历史线。" : "From Mesopotamia and Egypt to the Aegean and Homer, connect environment, technology, economics, structure, and art.",
    count: counts.history,
    href: `${base}${lang}/courses/history/`,
  },
  {
    id: "economy",
    label: isZh ? "价值迁移与经济" : "Value migration & economics",
    title: isZh ? "沿着货币与资本的流动，看懂现代世界" : "Follow money and capital to understand the modern world",
    description: isZh ? "从美元、美债、利率与银行信用出发，理解汇率、国际收支、资产价格和财富分配。" : "Use the dollar, Treasuries, rates, and bank credit to understand exchange rates, capital flows, and wealth.",
    count: counts.economy,
    href: `${base}${lang}/courses/economy/`,
  },
  {
    id: "kids",
    label: "For Kids",
    title: isZh ? "把数学放回生活里" : "Put mathematics back into everyday life",
    description: isZh ? "为孩子单独准备的生活数学与逻辑思考课程。36节课从真实问题出发，学习结构、规律、方法和实践验证。" : "A separate practical mathematics and logic program for children, built around real problems and independent thinking.",
    count: counts.math,
    href: `${base}${lang}/courses/kids/`,
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  lang={lang}
  title={isZh ? "公开课" : "Open Courses"}
  description={isZh ? "历史、经济与 For Kids 三个独立的公开课板块。" : "Three independent open-course tracks: history, economics, and For Kids."}
  alternatePath="/courses/"
>
  <header class="course-home-hero shell">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Open courses · 2026</p>
      <h1>{isZh ? "理解世界，从一条学习路线开始。" : "Understand the world, one learning path at a time."}</h1>
      <p class="lead">{isZh ? "历史与经济帮助我们理解世界如何形成、如何运转；For Kids 则让孩子从生活问题出发，学习数学、逻辑和独立思考。" : "History and economics explain how the world formed and works; For Kids begins with everyday problems to build mathematics, logic, and independent thinking."}</p>
    </div>
    <aside>
      <span>{isZh ? "三个独立板块" : "Independent tracks"}</span>
      <strong>03</strong>
      <p>{isZh ? `共 ${total} 节 · 持续更新` : `${total} lessons · Growing`}</p>
    </aside>
  </header>

  <section class="track-choices shell" aria-labelledby="track-choices-title">
    <header class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="kicker">Choose a path</p>
        <h2 id="track-choices-title">{isZh ? "选择一个板块，再展开课程" : "Choose a track, then explore its lessons"}</h2>
      </div>
      <p>{isZh ? "每个板块都有独立目录。进入下一层后，才会看到全部课节并逐课阅读。" : "Each track has its own archive. Enter it to browse and read individual lessons."}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="track-grid">
      {tracks.map((track) => <a class:list={["track-card", track.id]} href={track.href}>
        <div class="track-meta"><span>{track.label}</span><strong>{String(track.count).padStart(2, "0")}</strong></div>
        <h3>{track.title}</h3>
        <p>{track.description}</p>
        <span class="track-link">{isZh ? "进入课程目录" : "Open course archive"} <b aria-hidden="true">→</b></span>
      </a>)}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="course-preface shell" aria-labelledby="course-preface-title">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Preface</p>
      <h2 id="course-preface-title">{isZh ? "为什么开始这门公开课" : "Why I began these open courses"}</h2>
    </div>
    {isZh ? <div class="preface-copy">
      <p>这套公开课，最初是因为女儿喜欢画画。</p>
      <p>我想带她了解世界各地的艺术从何而来。但越往下看，我越意识到：美术史只是历史的一个切面。艺术从来不是孤立产生的，它背后还有地理环境、生产技术、经济关系、社会结构，以及每个时代的人如何理解世界。</p>
      <p>因此，我想把历史放回完整的文明脉络中学习：不只记住人物和年代，更要理解人类社会为什么会这样发展。</p>
      <p>而我自己一直喜欢经济，也希望看懂货币、资本、财富与周期背后的底层规律。经济的背后同样不只是数字，还有政治、制度、历史，以及人的欲望与选择。</p>
      <p>我始终相信，人应该不断探索和学习。了解历史，也是在了解我们自己；看懂世界，也是为了更清醒地生活在其中。</p>
    </div> : <div class="preface-copy">
      <p>These courses began because my daughter loves to draw.</p>
      <p>I wanted to understand where the art of different civilizations came from, but art history proved to be only one slice of a larger story shaped by environment, technology, economics, and social structure.</p>
      <p>I have also long been drawn to economics and the forces beneath money, capital, wealth, and cycles.</p>
      <p>To understand history is to understand ourselves; to see the world more clearly is to live in it more consciously.</p>
    </div>}
  </section>

  <section class="course-map shell" aria-labelledby="course-map-title">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">A connected model</p>
      <h2 id="course-map-title">{isZh ? "历史与经济，最终会在同一张图里相遇。" : "History and economics eventually meet on the same map."}</h2>
    </div>
    <p>{isZh ? "古代文明研究粮食、权力与秩序如何形成，现代经济研究货币、信用与财富如何流动。相隔五千年，底层问题仍然相通：人如何组织资源，又如何被自己创造的结构塑造。" : "Ancient history studies grain, power, and order; modern economics studies money, credit, and wealth. Both ask how people organize resources—and how their structures shape them in return."}</p>
    <div class="concepts">
      {(isZh ? ["环境与资源", "城市与国家", "文字与契约", "贸易与帝国", "美元体系", "利率与信用", "汇率与购买力", "财富与分配"] : ["Environment", "Cities & states", "Writing & contracts", "Trade & empire", "Dollar system", "Rates & credit", "Exchange rates", "Wealth & distribution"]).map((item) => <span>{item}</span>)}
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(:root) { --history: #9a4b31; --history-soft: #f2dfd6; --economy: #285f63; --economy-soft: #dcebea; --kids: #6f5b27; --kids-soft: #eee4c8; }
  .course-home-hero { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.35fr) minmax(260px, .65fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 7vw, 6rem); align-items: end; padding-block: clamp(4.5rem, 10vw, 8rem); }
  .kicker { margin: 0 0 .8rem; color: var(--accent); font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .15em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  h1, h2, h3 { font-family: "Songti SC", "STSong", Georgia, serif; font-weight: 500; }
  h1 { max-width: 850px; margin: 0; font-size: clamp(3.3rem, 8vw, 6.8rem); line-height: .98; }
  .lead { max-width: 730px; margin: 1.7rem 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.1vw, 1.4rem); }
  .course-home-hero aside { min-height: 245px; padding: 1.8rem; border-radius: 22px; background: var(--ink); color: white; }
  .course-home-hero aside span { color: #c6c7c1; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .14em; }
  .course-home-hero aside strong { display: block; margin-top: .5rem; font: 500 5.8rem/1 Georgia, serif; }
  .course-home-hero aside p { margin: .8rem 0 0; color: #c6c7c1; }
  .track-choices { padding-bottom: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem); }
  .section-head { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr minmax(280px, .55fr); gap: 3rem; align-items: end; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
  .section-head h2, .course-map h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5.5vw, 4.8rem); }
  .section-head > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
  .track-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
  .track-card { min-height: 360px; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.4rem); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 22px; background: var(--surface); color: inherit; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease; }
  .track-card:hover, .track-card:focus-visible { transform: translateY(-4px); box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(32,33,31,.09); outline: none; }
  .track-card.kids { grid-column: 1 / -1; min-height: 300px; background: var(--kids-soft); }
  .track-meta { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; }
  .track-meta span { font-size: .76rem; font-weight: 850; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .track-meta strong { font: 500 4.6rem/1 Georgia, serif; opacity: .18; }
  .history .track-meta span, .history .track-link { color: var(--history); }
  .economy .track-meta span, .economy .track-link { color: var(--economy); }
  .kids .track-meta span, .kids .track-link { color: var(--kids); }
  .track-card h3 { max-width: 720px; margin: 2.2rem 0 .8rem; font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem); line-height: 1.12; }
  .track-card p { max-width: 720px; color: var(--muted); }
  .track-link { display: inline-flex; gap: .45rem; align-items: center; margin-top: 1rem; font-weight: 850; }
  .track-link b { transition: transform .2s ease; }
  .track-card:hover .track-link b { transform: translateX(4px); }
  .course-preface { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(220px, .55fr) minmax(0, 1.45fr); gap: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 5rem); padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); border-radius: 22px; background: var(--accent-soft); }
  .course-preface h2 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 4rem); line-height: 1.12; }
  .preface-copy { max-width: 760px; }
  .preface-copy p { margin: 0 0 1rem; }
  .preface-copy p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--accent); font-weight: 750; }
  .course-map { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 2rem 4rem; margin-block: clamp(5rem, 10vw, 8rem); padding: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem); border-radius: 22px; background: var(--ink); color: var(--surface); }
  .course-map > p { align-self: end; margin: 0; color: #c7cbc7; }
  .concepts { display: flex; grid-column: 1 / -1; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .55rem; }
  .concepts span { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.17); border-radius: 999px; padding: .5rem .75rem; color: #e7e9e6; font-size: .82rem; }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .course-home-hero, .section-head, .course-preface, .course-map { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .track-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .track-card.kids { grid-column: auto; }
    .concepts { grid-column: auto; }
  }
</style>
